Clipboard Manager is a smart app that helps you to secure your content and increase amount of referrals of your store. 
 How it works? 
 Clipboard Manager secures your content from stealing and at the same time watching for users who copy-paste, drag’n’drop or save anything from your website. When they paste the content, Clipboard Manager adds the link to your website in order to highlight primary source.  

 For example:
So, if there is a text "The perfect piece to top off any outfit", after copying and pasting it user will get following: 

 "The perfect piece to top off any outfit" – read more at https://yourstore.com/my-product 
 How it will help me to sell more? 

 Clipboard Manager helps to ensure that your blogs and products are unique and available exclusively in your store; 
 increases traffic with backlinks added to copy-pasted text; 
 protects images from being saved and uploaded to other stores; 
 allows you to have higher rank in search engines because of uniqueness of your content. 

 How can I customize the app? 

 change the text added to copied content; 
 block copying text at all (selection is allowed); 
 allow or disallow "Save Image As" action; 
 block drag & drop. 

 Compatibility 

 works on desktop and mobile; 
 works with all themes; 
 works with shortcuts. 


 Note: Clipboard Manager does maximum to make it harder to steal your content. Still, there are always advanced ways to bypass restrictions, but this actions will require a lot more effort. 


 Show full description Show less

Why add Facebook comments? 
 Connecting Facebook commenting feature to your store is a nice option to introduce a new way for customers to express their opinion or ask a question. 
 How comments will affect my store? 
 Users opinions and reviews will start to appear at amazing speed. Every product will have its own set of reviews and comments from real people – trusted opinions can positively affect on sales conversion. 
 Are there customization options available? 
 Sure! You can: 


 enable or disable comments on product pages or on blog article pages; 
 change FB comments display mode (pop-up, animated comments block or plain display without effects); 
 customize design (comments button's color, font, size, text etc); 
 enter own Developer App ID to have more control under moderation, publication rules etc. 

 Which FB comments features are supported? 

 responsive design; 
 display comments counter; 
 comments moderation support; 
 comments notifications support; 
 facebook auth takes care of spam-filtering. 


 Notes:  


 when you're changing product's URLs (web address) or starting to use another theme, comments can be reset, as Facebook links all comments to specific URLs and it's technically not possible to transfer or export this comments to a "new" page. 
 Facebook Comments app is not related to Facebook company. 




               Integrates with 



      Facebook Comments



