Smart marketing assistant to grow customers and sales 
 Convead is a marketing platform that analyzes customer behavior, reveals sales bottlenecks, and provides tools and recommendations to increase revenue. 

 Upon entering an offline store, people are instantly approached by a salesperson. Otherwise, they are "just looking". A good salesperson carefully encourages shoppers to make a purchase – finds out their needs, gives personalized recommendations and introduces special offers. If visitors aren't quite ready for the purchase, a salesperson will try to get their contacts to reach out later. After the purchase, he'll stay in touch to inform customers about new goods and promotions. 

 Convead is the automatic "salesperson" for your online store, empowered by machine learning technology. It shows visitors the most relevant offers, asks for their contacts, and activates a live chat at the right moment. If your prospects are about to leave the store – Convead will do its best to retain or return them. It will notify your customers about promotions, never forget to wish them a happy birthday or remind to replenish their stocks. 

 With Convead's assistance, you can turn more visitors into buyers and increase conversion rates without additional expenses on advertising. 

 Convead allows ecommerce merchants to:
* Generate leads by collecting visitor emails;
* Track and analyze customer behavior to understand their preferences;
* Recover abandoned carts and upsell with automated campaigns;
* Chat with visitors via multiple channels;
* Carefully segment visitors, prospects, and customers to provide relevant offers;
* Increase repeat purchases and customer loyalty;
* Get valuable insights by using sales funnel visualization. 



               Integrates with 



      Facebook,


      Telegram,


      Viber



